<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - London Int'l upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - London Int'l upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its rating on London International Group Plc to near-term buy from accumulate, and kept the long-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- ADRs closed 13-5/8 on Thurday.</p>
</text>
